WEBVTT

00:04:28.845 --> 00:04:30.762
there will always be an element of those

00:04:30.762 --> 00:04:33.894
who seek the open road as a means of escape,

00:04:33.894 --> 00:04:38.952
of liberation and, of course, of rebellion.

00:04:38.952 --> 00:04:40.968
Thank you.

00:04:40.968 --> 00:04:43.237
(Applause)